{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Diariva 是一款完全離線運作的私密日記應用，適合想安靜記錄日常心情、想法與回憶的使用者。應用無需帳戶，沒有廣告與追蹤，所寫內容不會上傳，也不會被 AI 讀取，所有記錄只留在自己的裝置上。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線私密日記與心情追蹤</h2>\n<p>內建 20 種區塊類型與 24 款範本，另備 30 個寫作提示，也可由空白頁開始。一鍵心情打卡，自訂活動名稱與顏色，並建立飲水、閱讀等追蹤項目，再以 7、30、90 天洞察回顧書寫日數與心情變化。日曆支援日、週、月、年檢視，另有未來膠囊可寫信給自己。備份可存至自己的 iCloud，並設 PIN 鎖保護。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-762-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-763-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-764-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-765-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-766-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-767-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Diariva: Your life &amp; journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T07:39:52.869548+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}